    <fields>
        <fullName>Pricing_Performance_Metric_Nm__c</fullName>
        <description>Measures of quantitative assessment used for assessing, comparing, and tracking performance of intel products by the use of standardized testing methods to gauge the performance. There are several software packages on the market that can perform benchmarking. Chip makers use these benchmarks in marketing and promotion of new CPUs. Some popular benchmarking packages include Whetstone, Dhrystone, 3DMark, PCMark and others.</description>
        <label>Performance Metrics Used</label>
        <required>false</required>
        <trackHistory>true</trackHistory>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
        <type>Picklist</type>
